<title>USA: Covol Tech names Kimball as CFO.</title>
<headline>Covol Tech names Kimball as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>LEHI, Utah 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Covol Technologies Inc said on Monday it hired Stanley Kimball as chief financial officer, replacing Brent Cook, who was recently promoted to chief executive officer and president.</p>
<p>Kimball was vice president of administration and chief of staff at Huntsman Corp, the company said. He had extensive eperience in tax and tax accounting, the company said.</p>
